1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 12=

4
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:42,860
Do you have a wife back home?

5
00:01:44,220 --> 00:01:44,860
Your Majesty,

6
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:45,940
I do not.

7
00:01:47,030 --> 00:01:47,910
What do you think

8
00:01:49,190 --> 00:01:50,940
of my daughter, Princess Danyang?

9
00:02:00,910 --> 00:02:01,500
I dare not presume

10
00:02:01,940 --> 00:02:03,110
to comment on Her Highness.

11
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:04,910
Let's leave it at that.

12
00:02:07,190 --> 00:02:08,460
I'd like to play matchmaker

13
00:02:09,390 --> 00:02:11,420
and offer Princess Danyang
your hand in marriage.

14
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:12,420
What do you say?

15
00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:23,700
I wouldn't dare deceive Your Majesty.

16
00:02:27,230 --> 00:02:28,180
As it happens,

17
00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:29,390
one of my students

18
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:31,900
has long admired Princess Danyang, too.

19
00:02:32,510 --> 00:02:33,390
Which student?

20
00:02:33,700 --> 00:02:37,350
Wei Shu, the Top Scholar
Your Majesty appointed.

21
00:02:39,830 --> 00:02:41,399
If he admires the Princess,

22
00:02:41,441 --> 00:02:43,011
why didn't he speak up earlier?

23
00:02:45,860 --> 00:02:46,860
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

24
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:50,110
Is your family the noble Wei clan?

25
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:52,270
Yes.

26
00:02:52,860 --> 00:02:55,860
They say great families
are hard to fathom.

27
00:02:57,460 --> 00:02:58,510
I won't

28
00:02:59,510 --> 00:03:01,020
send Wanyao into one.

29
00:03:02,460 --> 00:03:03,020
Rise.

30
00:03:04,140 --> 00:03:04,950
Take your seats.

31
00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:06,180
Thank you, Your Majesty.

32
00:03:06,420 --> 00:03:07,070
Thank you, Your Majesty.

33
00:03:15,670 --> 00:03:16,110
Your Majesty,

34
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:19,460
(General Yu arrives!)

35
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:31,300
(Lanyue Hall)

36
00:03:36,830 --> 00:03:39,180
You're hosting
the realm's finest talents.

37
00:03:39,620 --> 00:03:41,900
Why wasn't I invited, Your Majesty?

38
00:03:42,950 --> 00:03:44,390
You've had your hands full.

39
00:03:44,670 --> 00:03:46,990
I didn't want to trouble you.

40
00:03:53,670 --> 00:03:56,350
I merely lighten Your Majesty's load.

41
00:03:56,790 --> 00:03:57,830
That hardly keeps me busy.

42
00:04:15,270 --> 00:04:16,030
Yuhan wine.

43
00:04:16,990 --> 00:04:18,030
A fine vintage from North Jing.

44
00:04:20,150 --> 00:04:21,180
Speaking of which,

45
00:04:22,990 --> 00:04:25,940
tribute wine from there
has grown scarce in recent years.

46
00:04:27,620 --> 00:04:27,990
Your Majesty,

47
00:04:29,470 --> 00:04:32,670
do you recall the customs
of the North Jing region?

48
00:04:34,350 --> 00:04:35,350
When a father or elder brother dies,

49
00:04:35,790 --> 00:04:36,910
his son or younger brother succeeds him.

50
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:39,860
Though General Meng Baiyu has died,

51
00:04:40,350 --> 00:04:42,940
his successor is still of the Meng clan.

52
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:43,620
So,

53
00:04:44,380 --> 00:04:45,180
I believe,

54
00:04:45,790 --> 00:04:47,420
Princess Danyang should marry

55
00:04:47,590 --> 00:04:50,110
neither the Top Scholar
nor the Third-Place Scholar,

56
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:52,990
but

57
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:55,710
Young General Meng,
the current military governor.

58
00:05:04,710 --> 00:05:05,260
Lord Yu,

59
00:05:06,300 --> 00:05:07,500
I'm a princess of Huai.

60
00:05:09,110 --> 00:05:11,030
Precisely because
you're a princess of Huai,

61
00:05:11,350 --> 00:05:14,470
you should put the people first.

62
00:05:15,470 --> 00:05:16,030
North Jing

63
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:17,470
is far from stable.

64
00:05:25,620 --> 00:05:26,420
Lord Yu,

65
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:30,230
we'll find another way
to secure North Jing.

66
00:05:31,740 --> 00:05:34,030
But when it comes to their marriage,

67
00:05:34,550 --> 00:05:35,940
we elders

68
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:38,030
shouldn't force their hand.

69
00:05:38,300 --> 00:05:40,260
We should ask what they want.

70
00:05:43,230 --> 00:05:43,910
Third-Place Scholar.

71
00:05:46,420 --> 00:05:46,940
Your Majesty.

72
00:05:47,590 --> 00:05:49,860
I'm offering you
my daughter's hand in marriage.

73
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:50,940
Will you accept?

74
00:06:00,110 --> 00:06:00,710
Your Majesty,

75
00:06:01,550 --> 00:06:01,910
I will

76
00:06:02,670 --> 00:06:03,150
accept.

77
00:06:03,690 --> 00:06:08,300
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

78
00:06:09,790 --> 00:06:10,470
(Yan Shang,)

79
00:06:10,860 --> 00:06:12,230
(at least you've got some backbone.)

80
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:14,260
But I won't accept it.

81
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:17,760
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

82
00:06:19,590 --> 00:06:20,180
Wanyao.

83
00:06:21,230 --> 00:06:22,639
You just asked what I wanted.

84
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,055
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

85
00:06:24,580 --> 00:06:24,940
I won't marry him.

86
00:06:24,989 --> 00:06:28,081
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

87
00:06:28,123 --> 00:06:29,813
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

88
00:06:33,060 --> 00:06:35,380
Princess Danyang knows
her duty to the realm.

89
00:06:35,710 --> 00:06:36,180
Good!

90
00:06:37,470 --> 00:06:37,860
Your Majesty,

91
00:06:39,790 --> 00:06:40,420
I congratulate you!

92
00:07:04,060 --> 00:07:04,590
Your Highness.

93
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:13,550
Right now,

94
00:07:13,990 --> 00:07:15,420
the man who pleases her most

95
00:07:16,420 --> 00:07:17,910
is Yan Shang.

96
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:21,590
Mr. Wei is probably too shy,

97
00:07:21,790 --> 00:07:24,030
unlike that bold third-place scholar.

98
00:07:24,230 --> 00:07:25,500
What third-place scholar?

99
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:27,470
So affected and coy,

100
00:07:27,790 --> 00:07:28,790
with flirtatious eyes.

101
00:07:29,260 --> 00:07:30,710
He looks like a shameless rake.

102
00:07:31,420 --> 00:07:33,230
He couldn't even outscore Wei Shu.

103
00:07:34,710 --> 00:07:36,550
With that fox around,

104
00:07:37,470 --> 00:07:39,500
it's really unfair to Wei Shu.

105
00:07:40,060 --> 00:07:41,030
Exactly.

106
00:07:41,350 --> 00:07:43,060
We'll never understand

107
00:07:43,470 --> 00:07:45,470
these princesses' tastes.

108
00:07:57,230 --> 00:07:57,710
Your Highness,

109
00:07:58,380 --> 00:07:59,470
His Majesty arranged that marriage

110
00:07:59,710 --> 00:08:00,470
to help you.

111
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:03,350
I know my father better than you do.

112
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:05,500
A marriage would keep you

113
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:07,030
from having to head north again.

114
00:08:07,470 --> 00:08:07,910
Yan Shang.

115
00:08:08,620 --> 00:08:09,420
Have you forgotten

116
00:08:09,910 --> 00:08:11,790
why I kept you by my side

117
00:08:12,110 --> 00:08:12,790
as my adviser?

118
00:08:13,590 --> 00:08:15,060
Have you forgotten
what I'm fighting for?

119
00:08:15,790 --> 00:08:16,710
When have I ever

120
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:18,110
sought safety for myself?

121
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:19,110
I haven't forgotten.

122
00:08:19,500 --> 00:08:20,670
That's why I came to tell you.

123
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:21,670
Even if...

124
00:08:24,860 --> 00:08:26,230
Even if there's no love between us,

125
00:08:26,710 --> 00:08:27,820
we can pretend there is.

126
00:08:28,350 --> 00:08:28,740
In private,

127
00:08:29,300 --> 00:08:30,420
I'll still be your right-hand man.

128
00:08:31,230 --> 00:08:31,710
In public,

129
00:08:32,380 --> 00:08:33,740
we'd just play the loving couple.

130
00:08:34,710 --> 00:08:35,860
It's only a temporary fix.

131
00:08:36,310 --> 00:08:36,830
I won't pretend.

132
00:08:39,110 --> 00:08:39,839
If the Central Circuit

133
00:08:39,881 --> 00:08:41,491
comes demanding that marriage one day,

134
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:43,660
at least we could hold them off.

135
00:08:43,900 --> 00:08:44,830
Yan Shang, listen carefully.

136
00:08:45,590 --> 00:08:47,710
I'm tired of being married off
like a pawn.

137
00:08:48,230 --> 00:08:49,990
Tired of having no choice
but to compromise.

138
00:08:50,070 --> 00:08:51,590
I won't stand for it anymore.

139
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:52,990
Your Highness...

140
00:09:06,430 --> 00:09:07,740
Mu Wanyao, stop!

141
00:09:07,950 --> 00:09:08,990
Mr. Yang, don't!

142
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:14,140
(Cui Family Residence)

143
00:09:16,020 --> 00:09:16,500
Wanyao!

144
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:20,990
Were you trying to kill yourself

145
00:09:21,350 --> 00:09:22,110
or take me down with you?

146
00:09:23,380 --> 00:09:24,470
If you won't marry Yan Shang,

147
00:09:25,110 --> 00:09:25,740
why not marry me instead?

148
00:09:26,590 --> 00:09:27,660
Why turn us all down so flatly?

149
00:09:28,070 --> 00:09:29,860
Yang Si, who do you think you are?

150
00:09:30,900 --> 00:09:32,740
Can you stop Yu Cheng'an or Meng Zaishi?

151
00:09:33,500 --> 00:09:35,140
If Yu Cheng'an
was just messing around today,

152
00:09:35,350 --> 00:09:36,350
I won't have to marry anyone.

153
00:09:37,470 --> 00:09:38,950
But if he really wants to send me north,

154
00:09:39,540 --> 00:09:41,599
Yan Shang, you, and Wei Shu

155
00:09:41,641 --> 00:09:43,091
all marrying me together

156
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:44,110
could not save me.

157
00:09:46,020 --> 00:09:46,620
When that happens,

158
00:09:47,070 --> 00:09:48,860
whoever becomes my consort
is as good as dead.

159
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:56,409
Wanyao...

160
00:09:56,451 --> 00:09:57,251
Go home to shed your tears.

161
00:09:57,430 --> 00:09:58,110
I'm not dead yet.

162
00:09:58,660 --> 00:09:59,070
Get lost, too!

163
00:10:08,070 --> 00:10:09,230
What does she mean, "too"?

164
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:14,990
Yan Shang.

165
00:10:16,350 --> 00:10:16,780
Wei Shu.

166
00:10:17,380 --> 00:10:18,110
Has the Imperial Uncle left?

167
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:20,590
Yan Shang,

168
00:10:21,350 --> 00:10:23,830
why did Lord Yu suddenly say all that?

169
00:10:24,500 --> 00:10:26,740
Does he really intend
to send Her Highness north?

170
00:10:28,350 --> 00:10:29,990
North Jing has been quiet lately

171
00:10:30,380 --> 00:10:31,830
and at peace with the court for years.

172
00:10:32,310 --> 00:10:33,260
Yu Cheng'an was probably

173
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:34,860
just speaking offhand.

174
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:36,070
(Finally, the exams are over.)

175
00:10:36,140 --> 00:10:37,540
- (What a relief!)
- (You said it!)

176
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:38,209
(Let's check over there.)

177
00:10:38,251 --> 00:10:38,921
(Come on, let's look this way.)

178
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:40,430
Other people's lives,

179
00:10:40,710 --> 00:10:41,620
other people's futures,

180
00:10:42,070 --> 00:10:43,590
mean nothing to him.

181
00:10:44,140 --> 00:10:45,380
So he jokes about them so casually.

182
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:46,710
Or perhaps,

183
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:48,990
he just meant to give the Princess
a warning

184
00:10:49,230 --> 00:10:49,860
and scare her.

185
00:10:50,230 --> 00:10:51,190
If this villain isn't eliminated,

186
00:10:51,830 --> 00:10:52,620
the realm will never know peace.

187
00:10:53,590 --> 00:10:55,500
Say that to anyone else,

188
00:10:56,020 --> 00:10:56,990
and your family

189
00:10:57,620 --> 00:10:59,140
could be doomed by tomorrow.

190
00:11:03,660 --> 00:11:04,900
If you're right

191
00:11:05,590 --> 00:11:07,070
and Lord Yu
was just trying to scare her,

192
00:11:07,430 --> 00:11:08,140
then Her Highness

193
00:11:08,620 --> 00:11:09,900
is safe only for now.

194
00:11:11,590 --> 00:11:12,140
Exactly.

195
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:14,110
The political landscape
can change overnight.

196
00:11:14,860 --> 00:11:15,710
The two military circuits in North Jing

197
00:11:16,660 --> 00:11:17,710
and the regional powers across the realm

198
00:11:18,190 --> 00:11:19,230
are poised to strike,

199
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:20,380
all aimed at the Imperial Court.

200
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:22,780
If the Central Circuit makes a move,

201
00:11:23,230 --> 00:11:23,710
the Princess

202
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:25,830
will be the first sacrifice.

203
00:11:28,660 --> 00:11:29,110
Let's go.

204
00:11:29,780 --> 00:11:30,500
I need to go back

205
00:11:31,190 --> 00:11:32,070
and apologize to the Princess.

206
00:11:32,620 --> 00:11:33,020
What's wrong?

207
00:11:33,740 --> 00:11:34,500
I upset her again

208
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:36,590
just now.

209
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:43,830
I hear

210
00:11:46,110 --> 00:11:47,540
the new top scholar, Wei Shu,

211
00:11:49,070 --> 00:11:50,190
is your student.

212
00:11:50,540 --> 00:11:50,860
That's right.

213
00:11:52,070 --> 00:11:53,260
So why are you singing

214
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:56,900
the third-place scholar's praises to me?

215
00:11:58,260 --> 00:11:59,190
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

216
00:12:00,310 --> 00:12:02,740
It's just that the third-place scholar

217
00:12:03,260 --> 00:12:04,230
is so charming.

218
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:05,540
I couldn't help

219
00:12:05,950 --> 00:12:08,140
going on about him in front of you.

220
00:12:09,990 --> 00:12:11,260
Charming?

221
00:12:12,430 --> 00:12:14,990
That's not a word I'd expect to hear

222
00:12:15,950 --> 00:12:16,780
from you.

223
00:12:17,430 --> 00:12:18,950
Your Highness may not know this.

224
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:22,140
That third-place scholar

225
00:12:22,230 --> 00:12:23,950
may not be the brightest,

226
00:12:24,710 --> 00:12:26,950
but his looks are second to none.

227
00:12:27,780 --> 00:12:28,590
I'd say

228
00:12:28,900 --> 00:12:31,380
he even outshines the men

229
00:12:31,950 --> 00:12:33,020
already by Your Highness's side.

230
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:48,350
Who are those two?

231
00:12:54,310 --> 00:12:54,860
Your Highness,

232
00:12:55,620 --> 00:12:58,070
they're this year's top
and third-ranked scholars.

233
00:13:00,710 --> 00:13:01,900
The one in white

234
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:03,140
is handsome enough,

235
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:05,470
but a bit too young.

236
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:07,070
He's not my type.

237
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:11,620
What's the name of the one
in very pale cyan?

238
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:12,740
Your Highness,

239
00:13:13,350 --> 00:13:15,260
that's Yan Shang,
the third-place scholar.

240
00:13:19,070 --> 00:13:19,620
Your Highness,

241
00:13:20,310 --> 00:13:22,070
was I wrong?

242
00:13:23,710 --> 00:13:25,020
For a man of your age,

243
00:13:25,540 --> 00:13:26,190
you certainly have

244
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:27,380
a good eye.

245
00:13:31,620 --> 00:13:32,780
Feng Xianyu,

246
00:13:34,110 --> 00:13:34,950
isn't it ironic?

247
00:13:36,710 --> 00:13:39,110
If you hadn't come to me that day

248
00:13:39,500 --> 00:13:42,190
and turned down fame and rank
out of sheer pride,

249
00:13:42,950 --> 00:13:43,740
today,

250
00:13:44,430 --> 00:13:45,759
I wouldn't have seen

251
00:13:45,801 --> 00:13:48,041
such a handsome third-place scholar.

252
00:13:49,590 --> 00:13:50,590
So I suppose

253
00:13:51,190 --> 00:13:52,590
I owe you my thanks.

254
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:16,940
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

255
00:14:51,110 --> 00:14:52,020
What's the rush?

256
00:14:52,260 --> 00:14:53,190
I have urgent news for Her Highness.

257
00:15:10,430 --> 00:15:11,020
Your Highness,

258
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:12,620
Lord Yu requests an audience.

259
00:15:19,380 --> 00:15:25,660
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

260
00:15:29,460 --> 00:15:34,540
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

261
00:15:34,590 --> 00:15:36,990
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

262
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:40,420
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

263
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:43,890
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

264
00:15:44,260 --> 00:15:46,730
♪With sacrificed innocence...♪

265
00:15:47,470 --> 00:15:47,950
Your Highness.

266
00:15:49,190 --> 00:15:49,660
Your Highness,

267
00:15:50,310 --> 00:15:51,344
Yan Shang is still standing in the rain.

268
00:15:51,386 --> 00:15:54,513
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

269
00:15:54,555 --> 00:15:56,215
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

270
00:15:56,710 --> 00:15:57,479
Why are you standing

271
00:15:57,521 --> 00:15:58,561
outside my door like a statue?

272
00:15:58,950 --> 00:15:59,620
Say what you have to say.

273
00:16:01,110 --> 00:16:01,830
If it's nonsense,

274
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:02,769
save your breath.

275
00:16:02,811 --> 00:16:05,599
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

276
00:16:05,641 --> 00:16:08,189
♪Through fire,
I'll turn the dark towers...♪

277
00:16:08,231 --> 00:16:09,711
I don't know where to begin.

278
00:16:10,380 --> 00:16:11,740
I'll wait until Your Highness returns

279
00:16:12,260 --> 00:16:12,714
and explain everything then.

280
00:16:12,756 --> 00:16:16,502
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

281
00:16:16,544 --> 00:16:19,591
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

282
00:16:19,633 --> 00:16:24,203
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

283
00:16:56,660 --> 00:16:57,140
Your Highness,

284
00:16:57,950 --> 00:16:58,860
I don't understand.

285
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:01,020
Why are you so angry with him?

286
00:17:03,860 --> 00:17:04,910
I'm not angry with him.

287
00:17:05,950 --> 00:17:06,910
The road ahead is dangerous,

288
00:17:07,230 --> 00:17:08,150
and our chances are slim.

289
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:10,630
I just wanted to tell him

290
00:17:11,740 --> 00:17:13,300
not to get his hopes up.

291
00:17:14,780 --> 00:17:15,710
And remind myself, too.

292
00:17:21,910 --> 00:17:23,780
A handwritten letter
from General Meng Zaishi,

293
00:17:23,950 --> 00:17:25,990
the new military governor
of the Central Circuit,

294
00:17:27,910 --> 00:17:29,870
has just arrived in Sheng'an.

295
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:31,060
Your Highness,

296
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:34,300
did you know him
when you were in the north?

297
00:17:35,910 --> 00:17:36,670
Not really.

298
00:17:38,950 --> 00:17:40,100
That's odd.

299
00:17:40,870 --> 00:17:43,430
General Meng is already twenty-three

300
00:17:44,060 --> 00:17:45,020
and still unmarried.

301
00:17:45,910 --> 00:17:46,910
That's rare enough.

302
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:50,020
Yet in his letter,
he didn't ask the Court

303
00:17:51,150 --> 00:17:52,230
to arrange a marriage for him.

304
00:17:52,670 --> 00:17:56,100
Instead, he asked after you
several times.

305
00:18:00,340 --> 00:18:00,780
Read it.

306
00:18:05,990 --> 00:18:07,820
As military governor
of the Central Circuit,

307
00:18:08,260 --> 00:18:09,470
General Meng must have included

308
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:11,780
important matters of state
in his letter.

309
00:18:12,740 --> 00:18:14,340
I'm just an ignorant woman.

310
00:18:16,910 --> 00:18:17,580
I wouldn't dare read it.

311
00:18:21,910 --> 00:18:23,230
Forgive me. I spoke out of turn.

312
00:18:25,470 --> 00:18:26,430
In that case,

313
00:18:28,100 --> 00:18:29,470
I'll just read

314
00:18:30,100 --> 00:18:32,670
a few lines to Your Highness.

315
00:18:33,430 --> 00:18:34,340
He's nothing more than

316
00:18:34,670 --> 00:18:35,430
a stranger to me.

317
00:18:36,670 --> 00:18:37,670
I don't care

318
00:18:38,390 --> 00:18:39,060
what his letter says.

319
00:18:44,060 --> 00:18:44,580
True.

320
00:18:47,340 --> 00:18:48,020
But...

321
00:18:48,910 --> 00:18:52,710
what if General Meng wants you
to marry into North Jing again?

322
00:19:02,100 --> 00:19:03,390
I'm a princess of Huai.

323
00:19:04,340 --> 00:19:06,470
It's my duty to ease
the court's burdens.

324
00:19:07,470 --> 00:19:09,540
Besides, I've been married there once.

325
00:19:10,100 --> 00:19:11,020
There's no need to make a fuss.

326
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:14,470
How sensible.

327
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:18,190
Since returning from North Jing,

328
00:19:18,430 --> 00:19:20,780
Your Highness has grown
much more composed.

329
00:19:21,150 --> 00:19:21,740
Impressive.

330
00:19:22,780 --> 00:19:23,430
Indeed.

331
00:19:24,260 --> 00:19:26,870
Some people lose their lives

332
00:19:27,260 --> 00:19:29,870
because they don't know
the ways of the world.

333
00:19:32,230 --> 00:19:32,990
Actually,

334
00:19:33,540 --> 00:19:34,820
there's nothing urgent today.

335
00:19:35,540 --> 00:19:37,580
I was just curious.

336
00:19:38,150 --> 00:19:39,020
What exactly

337
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:42,740
did you do in North Jing

338
00:19:43,150 --> 00:19:45,990
to make General Meng so taken with you?

339
00:19:54,100 --> 00:19:54,910
On second thought,

340
00:19:55,340 --> 00:19:55,950
there's no need to ask.

341
00:20:01,950 --> 00:20:03,500
Your Highness, please return.

342
00:20:11,430 --> 00:20:12,630
If General Meng

343
00:20:13,230 --> 00:20:14,910
really asks for your hand,

344
00:20:15,260 --> 00:20:17,390
it would help Huai

345
00:20:17,630 --> 00:20:18,780
keep the regional powers in check.

346
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:36,090
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

347
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:39,530
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

348
00:20:39,580 --> 00:20:45,520
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers
bright as day for you♪

349
00:20:46,090 --> 00:20:49,930
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

350
00:20:49,980 --> 00:20:53,300
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

351
00:20:53,350 --> 00:20:57,440
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

352
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:12,340
(Yu Cheng'an,)

353
00:21:13,780 --> 00:21:14,820
(this time, let's see)

354
00:21:16,740 --> 00:21:18,390
(will you kill me again,)

355
00:21:19,870 --> 00:21:21,430
(or will I kill you first?)

356
00:21:40,380 --> 00:21:44,420
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

357
00:21:54,670 --> 00:21:55,100
Your Highness.

358
00:21:57,060 --> 00:21:58,020
Third-Place Scholar,

359
00:21:58,740 --> 00:21:59,580
you know me?

360
00:22:00,060 --> 00:22:01,100
As a grand princess,

361
00:22:01,780 --> 00:22:03,540
who in Sheng'an doesn't?

362
00:22:05,100 --> 00:22:06,150
What a smooth talker.

363
00:22:07,340 --> 00:22:08,910
Come here. I have questions for you.

364
00:22:20,230 --> 00:22:20,950
Go ahead, Your Highness.

365
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:34,580
Why are you backing away?

366
00:22:38,780 --> 00:22:39,540
Your Highness is a noble princess,

367
00:22:40,100 --> 00:22:40,990
while I'm just a common scholar.

368
00:22:41,580 --> 00:22:43,580
I'll stay here and hear you out.

369
00:22:45,540 --> 00:22:46,580
Oh, you haven't been appointed yet.

370
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:48,670
No need to rush.

371
00:22:49,780 --> 00:22:51,710
Once we've had a proper chat,

372
00:22:52,190 --> 00:22:54,500
you won't have to worry
about that anymore.

373
00:22:55,670 --> 00:22:56,390
I appreciate

374
00:22:56,910 --> 00:22:57,870
Your Highness's kindness.

375
00:23:02,100 --> 00:23:03,190
Speaking of which,

376
00:23:04,020 --> 00:23:06,260
I've suddenly taken an interest
in history.

377
00:23:07,500 --> 00:23:08,340
However,

378
00:23:08,710 --> 00:23:09,990
there's a lot I don't understand.

379
00:23:12,020 --> 00:23:13,870
As a third-place scholar,
you must be well-read.

380
00:23:14,670 --> 00:23:17,230
Come to my residence and enlighten me.

381
00:23:22,540 --> 00:23:23,340
Forgive me, Your Highness.

382
00:23:24,260 --> 00:23:25,260
I'm just a country bumpkin

383
00:23:25,870 --> 00:23:26,740
with little talent or learning.

384
00:23:27,020 --> 00:23:27,740
I only passed the exam by luck.

385
00:23:28,580 --> 00:23:29,100
I'm afraid

386
00:23:29,950 --> 00:23:30,540
I'm not up to the task.

387
00:23:31,710 --> 00:23:32,150
I must take my leave.

388
00:23:34,820 --> 00:23:36,500
You've moved right next door
to Princess Danyang,

389
00:23:37,020 --> 00:23:38,580
so I thought you knew
how to play your cards.

390
00:23:39,670 --> 00:23:40,430
Turns out

391
00:23:41,150 --> 00:23:42,300
you're stubborn to the end.

392
00:23:43,820 --> 00:23:44,500
What,

393
00:23:45,100 --> 00:23:46,630
are you staying chaste for her?

394
00:23:50,740 --> 00:23:51,580
You're teasing me, Your Highness.

395
00:24:23,950 --> 00:24:24,740
When we get back,

396
00:24:25,020 --> 00:24:26,300
if Yan Shang is still waiting outside,

397
00:24:26,710 --> 00:24:27,470
let him in.

398
00:24:28,430 --> 00:24:29,390
Have you forgiven him?

399
00:24:30,060 --> 00:24:31,150
There's nothing to forgive.

400
00:24:32,300 --> 00:24:33,340
Keeping my distance for a few days

401
00:24:33,820 --> 00:24:34,500
will be better for us both.

402
00:24:36,630 --> 00:24:38,190
Then I'll invite him in

403
00:24:38,580 --> 00:24:40,150
and make some ginger tea to warm him up.

404
00:24:45,390 --> 00:24:46,780
(Peaceful days like this)

405
00:24:47,950 --> 00:24:49,020
(may be numbered.)

406
00:24:50,740 --> 00:24:52,020
(If my plans fail and I die,)

407
00:24:53,230 --> 00:24:53,710
(Yan Shang,)

408
00:24:54,820 --> 00:24:55,990
(how long will you remember me?)

409
00:25:03,990 --> 00:25:04,780
Careful, Your Highness.

410
00:25:13,740 --> 00:25:14,870
Isn't this the umbrella you gave him?

411
00:25:15,260 --> 00:25:15,990
Why did he leave it here?

412
00:25:19,430 --> 00:25:20,100
Here, Your Highness.

413
00:25:27,470 --> 00:25:27,910
Your Highness!

414
00:25:31,670 --> 00:25:32,190
Wei Shu?

415
00:25:32,740 --> 00:25:33,390
What brings you here?

416
00:25:33,630 --> 00:25:34,060
Your Highness,

417
00:25:34,470 --> 00:25:35,710
do you know where Yan Shang went?

418
00:25:36,230 --> 00:25:37,150
I'm worried about him.

419
00:25:37,470 --> 00:25:38,630
What's there to worry about?

420
00:25:39,390 --> 00:25:41,100
He was supposed
to study with me tonight.

421
00:25:41,870 --> 00:25:43,239
I waited outside his house for ages,

422
00:25:43,281 --> 00:25:44,081
but he never came back.

423
00:25:44,670 --> 00:25:45,740
He never misses an appointment.

424
00:25:45,990 --> 00:25:47,060
He's not one to break his word.

425
00:25:47,500 --> 00:25:48,100
You're right.

426
00:25:50,150 --> 00:25:51,020
He never breaks his promises.

427
00:25:58,780 --> 00:25:59,580
(Where could he have gone?)

428
00:26:00,230 --> 00:26:01,020
(Who summoned him?)

429
00:26:02,190 --> 00:26:02,580
(Or...)

430
00:26:03,100 --> 00:26:04,020
(who took him away?)

431
00:26:05,190 --> 00:26:05,910
(Yu Cheng'an?)

432
00:26:06,630 --> 00:26:07,340
(Li Zhi?)

433
00:26:08,060 --> 00:26:08,740
(Or Father?)

434
00:26:27,060 --> 00:26:28,060
You may all leave.

435
00:26:29,100 --> 00:26:31,670
Don't disturb me tonight.

436
00:26:50,820 --> 00:26:51,820
Yan Shang is clever.

437
00:26:52,150 --> 00:26:53,260
He should be fine.

438
00:26:53,820 --> 00:26:55,190
That depends on who's holding him

439
00:26:56,060 --> 00:26:56,820
and what trouble he's in.

440
00:27:06,100 --> 00:27:06,580
Your Highness.

441
00:27:07,740 --> 00:27:08,190
Found him?

442
00:27:08,540 --> 00:27:09,580
We've asked around.

443
00:27:09,870 --> 00:27:11,020
No one has seen Yan Shang.

444
00:27:13,910 --> 00:27:14,780
He's new to Sheng'an

445
00:27:15,260 --> 00:27:16,390
and barely knows anyone here.

446
00:27:18,060 --> 00:27:19,340
Who would want to harm him?

447
00:27:20,710 --> 00:27:21,580
Have you checked
the Crown Prince's place?

448
00:27:21,910 --> 00:27:22,470
I'll go now.

449
00:27:22,870 --> 00:27:23,390
Who's there?

450
00:27:23,710 --> 00:27:24,500
Who dares throw stones

451
00:27:24,630 --> 00:27:25,990
into the Princess's residence?

452
00:27:28,190 --> 00:27:28,820
Your Highness, look.

453
00:27:29,260 --> 00:27:30,710
There's a note wrapped around the stone.

454
00:27:32,340 --> 00:27:34,740
("He's at Xiangfeng Tower.")

455
00:27:38,950 --> 00:27:39,390
Fang Tong,

456
00:27:40,300 --> 00:27:40,950
gather the men.

457
00:27:41,430 --> 00:27:41,870
Come with me.

458
00:27:42,100 --> 00:27:43,100
Your Highness, where to?

459
00:27:44,100 --> 00:27:45,020
Grand Princess Luling's residence.

460
00:27:45,580 --> 00:27:46,150
Xiangfeng Tower.

461
00:27:48,020 --> 00:27:48,340
Understood.

462
00:27:53,740 --> 00:27:54,060
Your Highness, please.

463
00:27:54,260 --> 00:27:54,990
The carriage is too slow.

464
00:27:56,710 --> 00:27:57,100
Get down.

465
00:28:03,300 --> 00:28:04,630
Fang Tong, take the carriage.

466
00:28:04,870 --> 00:28:05,540
He can't ride.

467
00:28:28,990 --> 00:28:29,910
Third-Place Scholar,

468
00:28:33,020 --> 00:28:34,580
when you wake up,

469
00:28:35,630 --> 00:28:36,950
will you thank me

470
00:28:37,990 --> 00:28:39,340
or try to kill yourself?

471
00:28:40,540 --> 00:28:42,060
At least lying in my bed

472
00:28:42,990 --> 00:28:44,849
beats standing outside Wanyao's door

473
00:28:44,891 --> 00:28:46,171
in the cold rain.

474
00:28:46,950 --> 00:28:47,630
Besides,

475
00:28:49,060 --> 00:28:50,500
she can't even look after herself,

476
00:28:51,020 --> 00:28:53,430
yet she's playing at keeping pets.

477
00:28:53,740 --> 00:28:55,020
(Your Highness,
Princess Danyang is here.)

478
00:28:55,230 --> 00:28:56,230
(She says she's lost a cat.)

479
00:28:56,710 --> 00:28:58,020
(She saw it run in here.)

480
00:29:01,950 --> 00:29:03,710
Then show her to the flower hall.

481
00:29:03,990 --> 00:29:04,910
Make her comfortable.

482
00:29:05,190 --> 00:29:06,060
Let her wait!

483
00:29:07,020 --> 00:29:07,300
(Got it.)

484
00:29:11,630 --> 00:29:12,169
Meow, meow!

485
00:29:12,211 --> 00:29:12,809
(Your Highness, please return!)

486
00:29:12,851 --> 00:29:13,334
Come out, kitty!

487
00:29:13,376 --> 00:29:13,987
(Your Highness, please return!)

488
00:29:14,029 --> 00:29:14,669
- Meow, meow!
- (Your Highness, please return!)

489
00:29:15,020 --> 00:29:15,340
(Your Highness...)

490
00:29:15,870 --> 00:29:16,580
- Wanyao!
- (Your Highness, please return!)

491
00:29:17,020 --> 00:29:18,020
What's all this fuss?

492
00:29:22,230 --> 00:29:23,020
Forgive me, Aunt.

493
00:29:23,780 --> 00:29:25,300
I didn't mean to disturb your retreat.

494
00:29:25,740 --> 00:29:27,870
But that cat means the world to me.

495
00:29:28,780 --> 00:29:31,300
He's always by my side.

496
00:29:31,580 --> 00:29:32,670
I can't bear to be without him.

497
00:29:33,870 --> 00:29:35,820
He happened
to run into your residence today.

498
00:29:36,670 --> 00:29:37,500
So please,

499
00:29:37,870 --> 00:29:39,150
don't punish him.

500
00:29:39,540 --> 00:29:40,580
Why would I punish him?

501
00:29:41,990 --> 00:29:44,260
Would I really quarrel with an animal?

502
00:29:44,740 --> 00:29:47,020
And please, don't blame me either.

503
00:29:47,580 --> 00:29:49,580
I'll leave as soon as I find him.

504
00:29:50,710 --> 00:29:51,390
But

505
00:29:52,020 --> 00:29:52,740
I'll take back

506
00:29:53,820 --> 00:29:54,780
what's mine.

507
00:30:07,740 --> 00:30:08,430
Please, Aunt,

508
00:30:08,870 --> 00:30:09,780
let me search your residence.

509
00:31:38,740 --> 00:31:39,300
Your Highness...

510
00:31:57,340 --> 00:31:58,390
Take your time.

511
00:31:59,340 --> 00:32:00,580
I have no time for this.

512
00:32:04,780 --> 00:32:05,060
You...

513
00:32:10,100 --> 00:32:10,500
Yan Shang!

514
00:32:13,020 --> 00:32:13,470
Yan Shang!

515
00:32:18,100 --> 00:32:18,910
How strange.

516
00:32:19,390 --> 00:32:20,540
What is he doing here?

517
00:32:21,150 --> 00:32:22,910
Ask him yourself.

518
00:32:23,430 --> 00:32:23,870
Fine.

519
00:32:24,430 --> 00:32:25,150
I'll ask him

520
00:32:25,630 --> 00:32:26,470
when he wakes up.

521
00:32:27,670 --> 00:32:28,060
Let's go.

522
00:32:28,390 --> 00:32:28,870
Stop!

523
00:32:28,990 --> 00:32:29,740
Guards!

524
00:32:34,020 --> 00:32:34,950
Don't mind me.

525
00:32:35,150 --> 00:32:35,430
Shut up!

526
00:32:36,390 --> 00:32:36,990
Wanyao,

527
00:32:38,430 --> 00:32:39,910
stop playing dumb.

528
00:32:41,260 --> 00:32:42,780
Let's be frank.

529
00:32:43,260 --> 00:32:43,910
This man

530
00:32:44,300 --> 00:32:45,430
should count himself lucky

531
00:32:46,150 --> 00:32:47,500
that I'd even fancy him.

532
00:32:49,430 --> 00:32:51,540
You and I really do share

533
00:32:51,950 --> 00:32:52,710
the same taste.

534
00:32:53,470 --> 00:32:54,870
I happen to like him, too.

535
00:32:55,670 --> 00:32:56,910
To have us both fall for him,

536
00:32:57,300 --> 00:32:58,470
he's a lucky man indeed.

537
00:33:00,020 --> 00:33:00,820
So please, Aunt,

538
00:33:01,950 --> 00:33:02,780
let me take him away.

539
00:33:05,470 --> 00:33:06,190
Wanyao,

540
00:33:07,390 --> 00:33:09,390
you've spent too long in North Jing

541
00:33:09,780 --> 00:33:12,260
and forgotten your place here.

542
00:33:14,300 --> 00:33:15,740
You can remain in Sheng'an

543
00:33:16,300 --> 00:33:18,190
only at others' mercy!

544
00:33:20,190 --> 00:33:21,060
Thanks for the reminder.

545
00:33:22,670 --> 00:33:23,670
I know my place.

546
00:33:23,950 --> 00:33:25,150
Then leave him here

547
00:33:25,430 --> 00:33:27,300
and go home quietly.

548
00:33:27,670 --> 00:33:30,430
I'll forgive a young fool
who doesn't know any better.

549
00:33:31,340 --> 00:33:32,820
But mark my words.

550
00:33:33,390 --> 00:33:34,340
Even if

551
00:33:35,300 --> 00:33:36,390
you take him today,

552
00:33:37,150 --> 00:33:37,710
tomorrow,

553
00:33:38,470 --> 00:33:39,910
one word from me,

554
00:33:40,670 --> 00:33:42,020
and my agents

555
00:33:42,390 --> 00:33:43,540
will come to your door

556
00:33:44,020 --> 00:33:45,340
and bring him back to me.

557
00:33:45,740 --> 00:33:46,950
There's nothing you can do.

558
00:33:58,630 --> 00:33:59,260
What are you doing?

559
00:33:59,740 --> 00:34:00,870
This is my residence!

560
00:34:01,230 --> 00:34:02,060
Have you gone mad?

561
00:34:02,710 --> 00:34:03,500
You're right, Aunt.

562
00:34:04,540 --> 00:34:05,340
I have nothing.

563
00:34:05,990 --> 00:34:06,870
I am nothing.

564
00:34:07,430 --> 00:34:08,310
I can't ask for anything.

565
00:34:09,870 --> 00:34:10,830
And I can't take him away.

566
00:34:11,700 --> 00:34:12,180
So,

567
00:34:12,830 --> 00:34:13,470
I don't want him anymore.

568
00:34:14,540 --> 00:34:15,660
I might as well kill him.

569
00:34:17,140 --> 00:34:18,750
I'll kill him here today.

570
00:34:19,390 --> 00:34:19,910
Tomorrow,

571
00:34:20,500 --> 00:34:22,430
I'll go beg Father to forgive me.

572
00:34:23,390 --> 00:34:25,990
Blame the Third-Place Scholar's
bad luck.

573
00:34:27,270 --> 00:34:28,830
I'll borrow your fine residence

574
00:34:29,620 --> 00:34:31,830
to dispose of this pretty troublemaker.

575
00:34:33,540 --> 00:34:33,950
Stop!

576
00:34:42,580 --> 00:34:43,140
Out of the way!

577
00:34:43,790 --> 00:34:44,430
Let them go!

578
00:34:51,540 --> 00:34:51,910
You...

579
00:34:56,060 --> 00:34:57,750
You can't commit such a crime here.

580
00:34:58,700 --> 00:34:59,700
Take your thing

581
00:35:00,470 --> 00:35:01,060
and get out!

582
00:35:06,460 --> 00:35:09,900
(Grand Princess Luling's Residence)

583
00:35:27,060 --> 00:35:27,910
Your Highness...

584
00:35:29,020 --> 00:35:30,470
What on earth did she do to you?

585
00:35:30,910 --> 00:35:31,700
You're still out of your mind.

586
00:35:34,950 --> 00:35:35,830
Your Highness...

587
00:35:37,470 --> 00:35:38,390
Look at me carefully.

588
00:35:39,390 --> 00:35:40,540
Which princess am I?

589
00:35:46,620 --> 00:35:47,950
I know.

590
00:35:49,350 --> 00:35:50,060
You're...

591
00:35:51,830 --> 00:35:52,500
Mu...

592
00:35:53,430 --> 00:35:53,950
Wan...

593
00:35:55,100 --> 00:35:55,660
yao.

594
00:36:00,350 --> 00:36:01,700
You're only this bold

595
00:36:02,660 --> 00:36:03,830
when you're out of your mind.

596
00:36:05,060 --> 00:36:05,750
Once you come to,

597
00:36:06,910 --> 00:36:07,750
how much will you remember?

598
00:36:15,180 --> 00:36:15,990
Don't move.

599
00:36:19,700 --> 00:36:20,449
What are you doing?

600
00:36:20,491 --> 00:36:21,161
Wanyao...

601
00:36:26,140 --> 00:36:31,330
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

602
00:36:31,780 --> 00:36:37,810
♪- Through trails of mud and blood
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

603
00:36:39,510 --> 00:36:43,000
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

604
00:36:43,050 --> 00:36:44,380
♪Burning bright as a song♪

605
00:36:44,580 --> 00:36:48,410
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

606
00:36:48,720 --> 00:36:53,090
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

607
00:36:54,140 --> 00:36:57,770
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

608
00:36:58,610 --> 00:37:00,800
♪Not a single hour less♪

609
00:37:00,850 --> 00:37:07,760
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

610
00:37:08,290 --> 00:37:11,730
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

611
00:37:11,930 --> 00:37:15,390
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

612
00:37:15,440 --> 00:37:22,440
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

613
00:37:22,660 --> 00:37:24,290
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

614
00:37:24,340 --> 00:37:25,189
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

615
00:37:25,231 --> 00:37:25,819
Your Highness, what's wrong?

616
00:37:27,500 --> 00:37:28,540
♪You're the only one I need♪

617
00:37:28,540 --> 00:37:29,060
Nothing.

618
00:37:29,870 --> 00:37:30,324
Keep driving.

619
00:37:30,366 --> 00:37:37,197
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

620
00:37:37,239 --> 00:37:40,345
♪Be my one and only in this world;
be my one and only in this life♪

621
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:42,860
♪My last untouched innocence♪

622
00:37:47,660 --> 00:37:50,980
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

623
00:38:04,020 --> 00:38:04,990
Your Highness, we're here.

624
00:38:11,910 --> 00:38:12,270
Your Highness.

625
00:38:20,140 --> 00:38:21,159
Help me carry him down.

626
00:38:21,201 --> 00:38:21,851
I can't manage him alone.

627
00:38:22,990 --> 00:38:23,310
Got it.

628
00:38:25,080 --> 00:38:28,030
♪You're the only one I need♪

629
00:38:34,060 --> 00:38:35,270
Why is he lying on the ground?

630
00:38:35,870 --> 00:38:36,910
Her Highness could've warned me!

631
00:38:41,790 --> 00:38:43,470
Yan Shang, sit here for a moment.

632
00:38:44,870 --> 00:38:45,470
Thank you.

633
00:38:47,830 --> 00:38:48,790
So polite.

634
00:38:49,060 --> 00:38:49,950
You're barely conscious,

635
00:38:50,180 --> 00:38:51,220
yet you still remember your manners.

636
00:38:53,020 --> 00:38:53,870
A true scholar indeed.

637
00:39:22,660 --> 00:39:23,500
Don't push yourself.

638
00:39:23,950 --> 00:39:24,950
The physician will be here soon.

639
00:40:31,350 --> 00:40:33,140
Wh-what are you trying to do?

640
00:41:10,140 --> 00:41:10,580
Yan Shang!

641
00:41:37,430 --> 00:41:38,060
Your Highness.

642
00:41:39,500 --> 00:41:40,540
I'm sorry about earlier.

643
00:41:43,140 --> 00:41:43,500
You...

644
00:41:45,700 --> 00:41:46,580
You remember everything?

645
00:41:50,140 --> 00:41:50,700
I...

646
00:42:41,580 --> 00:42:42,500
When did you wake up?

647
00:42:43,620 --> 00:42:44,430
A little while ago.

648
00:42:46,540 --> 00:42:47,270
Why didn't you say anything?

649
00:42:48,830 --> 00:42:49,870
I was afraid you'd throw me out again

650
00:42:50,660 --> 00:42:51,950
if I spoke,

651
00:42:53,020 --> 00:42:53,990
just like last time.

652
00:42:57,580 --> 00:42:58,500
You were lucky this time.

653
00:43:00,100 --> 00:43:01,910
You're injured and caught a chill.

654
00:43:03,100 --> 00:43:04,430
Heartless as I am,

655
00:43:04,830 --> 00:43:06,220
I wouldn't throw you out tonight.

656
00:43:08,350 --> 00:43:09,100
Get some rest.

657
00:43:11,910 --> 00:43:12,470
Your Highness.

658
00:43:13,790 --> 00:43:14,470
Why?

659
00:43:15,350 --> 00:43:16,100
Why what?

660
00:43:16,910 --> 00:43:19,100
Why did you go alone
to the Grand Princess's

661
00:43:19,390 --> 00:43:20,220
and provoke her?

662
00:43:21,790 --> 00:43:23,310
She's the last person in Sheng'an

663
00:43:23,830 --> 00:43:25,270
you should offend.

664
00:43:25,470 --> 00:43:26,310
You have the nerve to say that?

665
00:43:27,430 --> 00:43:28,060
If I hadn't come,

666
00:43:28,790 --> 00:43:30,540
she would've devoured you alive.

667
00:43:30,750 --> 00:43:31,470
So what?

668
00:43:31,990 --> 00:43:32,830
What do you mean?

669
00:43:37,500 --> 00:43:38,830
Are you in your right mind?

670
00:43:41,750 --> 00:43:43,310
So what if I couldn't escape

671
00:43:44,350 --> 00:43:45,100
the Grand Princess?

672
00:43:46,580 --> 00:43:48,750
Why risk your life to save me?

673
00:43:50,620 --> 00:43:51,060
Yan Shang,

674
00:43:52,180 --> 00:43:53,430
don't think that being injured

675
00:43:54,350 --> 00:43:55,500
will stop me from throwing you out.

676
00:43:56,750 --> 00:43:58,430
Because Your Highness feels about me

677
00:43:59,620 --> 00:44:01,220
exactly as I feel

678
00:44:03,620 --> 00:44:04,470
about Your Highness.

679
00:44:18,910 --> 00:44:19,430
Your Highness,

680
00:44:21,430 --> 00:44:22,500
at the banquet that day,

681
00:44:24,140 --> 00:44:25,180
I wanted to tell you...

682
00:44:25,580 --> 00:44:25,990
Yan Shang.

683
00:44:28,140 --> 00:44:28,750
Don't say it.

684
00:44:37,910 --> 00:44:38,830
What happened tonight,

685
00:44:40,620 --> 00:44:41,350
and whatever lies between us,

686
00:44:43,910 --> 00:44:44,620
ends here.

687
00:44:47,620 --> 00:44:48,500
There are too many things

688
00:44:50,100 --> 00:44:51,470
left unfinished in Sheng'an.

689
00:44:53,950 --> 00:44:54,790
Even if I achieve everything

690
00:44:56,060 --> 00:44:56,830
I've set out to do one day,

691
00:44:58,830 --> 00:44:59,470
I'll never

692
00:45:01,310 --> 00:45:02,910
form a bond with anyone

693
00:45:03,910 --> 00:45:04,390
or marry.

694
00:45:11,870 --> 00:45:12,540
I'll say this

695
00:45:13,950 --> 00:45:14,830
only once.

696
00:45:18,020 --> 00:45:18,950
Don't bring it up again.

697
00:45:21,700 --> 00:45:22,310
Why?

698
00:45:37,260 --> 00:45:41,860
(Next Episode Preview)

699
00:45:42,540 --> 00:45:43,870
Everyone in Sheng'an knows

700
00:45:43,950 --> 00:45:45,790
how talented you are, Mr. Wei.

701
00:45:46,220 --> 00:45:46,910
You...

702
00:45:47,180 --> 00:45:48,310
you're not wed yet, are you?

703
00:45:48,830 --> 00:45:49,500
Your Highness,

704
00:45:49,950 --> 00:45:50,540
what is it?

705
00:45:50,700 --> 00:45:52,310
The most sought-after
young man of the Wei family

706
00:45:53,060 --> 00:45:53,990
is none other than you.

707
00:45:54,700 --> 00:45:56,700
And you're much more to my taste.

708
00:45:58,840 --> 00:46:02,133
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

709
00:46:04,818 --> 00:46:09,734
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

710
00:46:11,928 --> 00:46:17,773
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

711
00:46:18,273 --> 00:46:23,499
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

712
00:46:26,268 --> 00:46:31,059
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

713
00:46:31,895 --> 00:46:37,974
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

714
00:46:39,775 --> 00:46:42,925
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

715
00:46:42,925 --> 00:46:44,573
♪Burning bright as a song♪

716
00:46:44,625 --> 00:46:48,349
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

717
00:46:48,727 --> 00:46:53,393
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

718
00:46:54,012 --> 00:46:58,053
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

719
00:46:58,544 --> 00:47:00,659
♪Not a single hour less♪

720
00:47:00,699 --> 00:47:07,645
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

721
00:47:08,408 --> 00:47:11,861
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

722
00:47:12,041 --> 00:47:15,186
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

723
00:47:15,625 --> 00:47:22,262
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

724
00:47:22,659 --> 00:47:24,697
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

725
00:47:24,697 --> 00:47:27,173
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

726
00:47:27,211 --> 00:47:29,680
♪You're the only one I need♪

727
00:47:29,884 --> 00:47:36,771
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

728
00:47:37,083 --> 00:47:40,354
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

729
00:47:40,659 --> 00:47:43,832
♪My last untouched innocence♪

730
00:47:44,156 --> 00:47:47,582
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

731
00:47:47,815 --> 00:47:51,040
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

732
00:47:51,371 --> 00:47:58,167
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

733
00:47:58,536 --> 00:48:00,598
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

734
00:48:00,599 --> 00:48:03,102
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

735
00:48:03,149 --> 00:48:05,487
♪You're the only one I need♪

736
00:48:05,718 --> 00:48:12,553
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

737
00:48:12,902 --> 00:48:14,520
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

738
00:48:14,650 --> 00:48:16,446
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

739
00:48:16,803 --> 00:48:19,820
♪You're the only one I need♪

740
00:48:19,860 --> 00:48:21,187
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

